 <p><a href="https://svkm.mapmyaccess.com/"><strong>Click here for accessing e-resouces:</strong></a></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Web OPAC</strong></li>
<li>A dynamic&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Public&nbsp;Access&nbsp;Catalogue serves users as a union catalogue of SVKM institutions. A search is available through author, title, subject, publisher, ISBN and Boolean logic queries. Users can reserve books and check the transaction history using their login Ids.</li>
</ul>
<p><a href="http://library.svkm.ac.in/"><strong>Click here for WebOPAC link.</strong></a></p>

               </div>
               
               
               
               <!--new tabe e services start-->
                 <div id="e-services" class="tab-pane fade">
                <h4><b> Services</b></h4>
                


<ul>
<li>Students must carry their&nbsp;<strong><u>ID card</u></strong>and make an entry on RFID Machine by tapping their ID Card while entering &amp; exiting library.</li>
<li>Talking on mobile phone in the library premises is prohibited. Keep your mobiles on silent mode.&nbsp;</li>
<li>Discussion is not allowed in Reading hall and Digital Lab.</li>
<li>Eatables are not allowed in the library.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<ul>
<li><strong>Home Lending:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></li>
<li>Members can borrow books as per their respective program&rsquo;s lending policies. For more details, approach at the library counter.&nbsp;</li>
</ul>



